OL,3,GNEWSABridge repairs start after police
OL,4,A'laptop' crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FRepairs have started on a Grade
OL,7,FII-listed bridge several months after a
OL,8,Fpolice car crashed into it when an
OL,9,Fofficer's laptop became lodged in the
OL,10,Fvehicle's steering column.
OL,12,FOne lane has been closed on Worcester
OL,13,FBridge, in Worcestershire, while
OL,14,Fdamaged stonework is repaired using
OL,15,Fspecialist conservation techniques
OL,16,Fdesigned to preserve the historic
OL,17,Fbridge.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
