OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSABridge repairs start after police
OL,4,A'laptop' crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn March, West Mercia Police said the
OL,7,Fdriver lost the ability to steer when a
OL,8,Floose laptop became stuck in the
OL,9,Fsteering column, resulting in a
OL,10,Flow-speed collision with the bridge
OL,11,Fparapet.
OL,13,FWorcestershire County Council said the
OL,14,Fwork was expected to take up to three
OL,15,Fweeks, with motorists warned to expect
OL,16,Fdelays, particularly at peak times.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
